# The theme a fresh Agentarchy install lands on. One slug, naming a directory under themes/.
#
# It lives in a file because two things need the answer and only one of them has a shell:
# oal-bootstrap.sh exports it as OAL_DEFAULT_THEME for the rest of an install, and oal-greeter-sync
# runs from a systemd unit with no environment to inherit it from. Set OAL_DEFAULT_THEME in the
# environment to install a different theme without editing this.

agentarchy
